            {
                "entry_id": "24b4cdbd-19f7-32f8-9c7d-7ee14fdf6ea4",
                "word": "Tophet",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "7e7f2328-0a19-4549-86ee-985567b3cc49",
                        "entry_id": "24b4cdbd-19f7-32f8-9c7d-7ee14fdf6ea4",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "Topheth"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba4bbc2e-c6fc-39d9-bdea-ec09c64515e9",
                        "entry_id": "24b4cdbd-19f7-32f8-9c7d-7ee14fdf6ea4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Endroit de l’ancienne Jérusalem, situé dans la vallée de la Géhenne, que quelques-uns croient n’avoir été que la boucherie de la ville, où l’on entretenait aussi un feu continuel pour réduire en cendres les carcasses des animaux et d’autres immondices qu’on y apportait de tous les quartiers."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6be663ae-8728-422d-a3d4-647427700604",
                                "sense_id": "ba4bbc2e-c6fc-39d9-bdea-ec09c64515e9",
                                "text": "Et ils ont bâti les hauts lieux de Tophet, qui est dans la vallée du fils de Hinnom, pour brûler leurs fils et leurs filles au feu, ce que je n’ai pas commandé, et à quoi je n’ai point pensé.\nC’est pourquoi voici, les jours viennent, dit l’Eternel, qu’elle ne sera plus appelée Tophet, ni la vallée du fils de Hinnom, mais la vallée de la tuerie ; et on ensevelira les morts à Tophet, à cause qu’il n’y aura plus d’autre lieu."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e420d6f1-72e1-371b-ae4f-adbfab67ade3",
                        "entry_id": "24b4cdbd-19f7-32f8-9c7d-7ee14fdf6ea4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lieu damné et condamné."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "metonymically"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e06aa146-4849-40f8-bc17-f4082f835549",
                                "sense_id": "e420d6f1-72e1-371b-ae4f-adbfab67ade3",
                                "text": "Norfolk est une île murée. On n’admet dans ce Tophet que les damnés et les démons tourmenteurs."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9cb2f817-a7fa-4173-aa95-76553730e2c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "24b4cdbd-19f7-32f8-9c7d-7ee14fdf6ea4",
                        "target_lang_word": "Tofet",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d9ce9142-116b-41b3-9463-dfd6f69c96bf",
                        "source_entry_id": "24b4cdbd-19f7-32f8-9c7d-7ee14fdf6ea4",
                        "target_lang_word": "Tophet",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Tophet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc876df2-6e19-3929-bdf0-58bf3e7b2741",
                                        "entry_id": "782f01b3-da4f-3038-b3e1-584cd8cc8d87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A location near Jerusalem in the valley of Gehenna where children were burned alive as sacrifice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19f3c964-9113-443f-a48e-be7d113d2acc",
                                                "sense_id": "cc876df2-6e19-3929-bdf0-58bf3e7b2741",
                                                "text": "And they have built the high places of Tophet, which is in the valley of the son of Hinnom, to burn their sons and their daughters in the fire; which I commanded them not, neither came it into my heart."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3602b565-8f3f-3d0a-8e36-810e9ac98481",
                                        "entry_id": "782f01b3-da4f-3038-b3e1-584cd8cc8d87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hell, Gehenna."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "924c4047-3ba3-4aac-a348-a76634ad11c3",
                                                "sense_id": "3602b565-8f3f-3d0a-8e36-810e9ac98481",
                                                "text": "In this Tophet, they commonly immolated their little children, and sometimes men of more yeers than discretion […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee2bafed-c257-4fa2-9145-16f7d1ac7451",
                                                "sense_id": "3602b565-8f3f-3d0a-8e36-810e9ac98481",
                                                "text": "But already is the day of their avengement begun; the hero is at length arisen who shall send all such as bear enmity to the true Church, or trust in works of their own, to Tophet!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ffc84df-301d-4ac0-b676-c0645f335afa",
                                                "sense_id": "3602b565-8f3f-3d0a-8e36-810e9ac98481",
                                                "text": "“Well,” I says, “I cal'late a body could get used to Tophet if he stayed there long enough.” ¶ She flared up; the least mite of a slam at Doctor Wool was enough to set her going."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
